{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2023-05-25 08:26:00', 'title': 'WALGREENS ANNOUNCES WINNERS FOR THE 2023 EXPRESSIONS BY WALGREENS ART CHALLENGE', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALGREENS IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THE WINNERS AND FINALISTS FOR OUR 13TH ANNUAL EXPRESSIONS BY WALGREENS ART CHALLENGE. THE NATIONAL CONTEST PROVIDES MONETARY AWARDS TO WINNING HIGH SCHOOL STUDENT SUBMISSIONS FROM AROUND THE COUNTRY. ELIGIBLE ENTRIES ARE JUDGED IN FOUR CATEGORIES INCLUDING VISUAL ARTS, MEDIA ARTS, SPOKEN WORD AND CREATIVE WRITING. ADDITIONALLY, PRIZES ARE PRESENTED TO STUDENT SUBMISSIONS EARNING THE MOST ONLINE VOTES IN EACH CATEGORY AND TO TEAC.'}